  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">High-level Joint Working Group visit to the Netherlands CT Waste Management</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">A visit of the fifth Joint Working Group India - the Netherlands on sustainable urban development will take place in the Netherlands 30 April &#x2013; 2 May. Meetings with Dutch stakeholders and selected site visits on topics of (among others) social housing; application of the Internet-of-Things (IoT), remote sensing and artificial intelligence (AI) in governance; urban mobility; and waste management and segregation will provide new insights and knowledge to the Indian delegation.</narrative>
  </description>
